=3D""><div class=3D"entity-content"><p>it is said here that the effect of f=
eatures is, at best, doubling the T/D points generated by the affected "fie=
ld/mission", but the but the D/T point algorithm describes the D/T point ge=
neration as follows:
</p><p>"Current Quality Factor of Staff" * "T,D Skill Focus of Staff" * "De=
velopment focus" * "Staff Responsibility Factor" * ( "Mission+Engine Value"=
 + "Feature Bonus" )
</p><p>there's no reason why features can't have a bigger effect than just =
doubling D/T points, unless the "Feature Bonus" is capped by "Mission+Engin=
e Value", but this is mentioned nowhere.
</p><p>"Feature Bonus" is only limited by feature efficiency (and feature l=
evel, but not relevant here) which depends on game size and time attributed=
 to the mission
</p></div></div></div></div><div class=3D"ReplyList_container__bj-35"><span=
