iv></div></div><div class=3D""><div class=3D"entity-content"><p>I started u=
sing the tips in this guide at year 24 in a game. I had 2 developers (mysel=
f and one more) pretty nice levled up, and a lot of small games published. =
I had just hit 100K followers and self-published 2 titles which took me fro=
m 4M in the bank to 9M, which i was pretty happy with. Then i hired a third=
 employee, welcome-trained him and made a small game to make him settle, an=
d went on to make a medium game with the advice from this guide and timed i=
t so i could get a medium game convention booth in the middle of developmen=
t, and with a medium advert campaign. Thing sold over 3.4M copies and made =
36M profit...
</p><p>Now i'm at Y27, and a game just sold 1.8M copies for 20M the first m=
onth and passed 5M copies in 4 months, taking me from 96M to 152M.
</p><p>I'm very happy with this guide, and i'll try it from the beginning i=
n my next game :D
