><p>Interesseting how different strategies can be.
</p><p>When i tried the early "walkthrough" i made several games in the ran=
ge of 6-7 without scoring one game above 8 at the beginning of Y3.
</p><p>When i decided to follow my own strategy, creating a custom engine f=
ast and ramping up the features to get that 9+ hit fast, i moved to the sec=
ond stage at the beginning of Y3 with over 3M in the bank, while researchin=
g the stuff for my second engine. (And i make the move in the early months =
of Y3 consistently)
</p><p>Game#6 was the 9.75 Hit, generating a 1.7M profit, Game#7 and #8 wer=
e 8.75 and 9.25, generating 880k and 760k Profit.
</p><p>While this guide had a lot of usefull information, especially in the=
 first part i don't see it as the one and only way to success.
