s=3D""><div class=3D"entity-content"><p>I've read the whole article and i u=
nderstand it. I just don't agree with you that waiting for the gameling is =
the right or best choice.
</p><p>Ok, so i loose around 3M because i made that hit to early, but what =
i get in return is an earlier access to the second stage. And that means to=
 training and medium games.
</p><p>Maybe your guide is the best way if i really calculate and write dow=
n my game score and reload if i get unlucky with the bubbles so that i can =
get constanly 9+ games. But if i don't and most of my games are in the rang=
e of 8-9.5 (which they are) then a medium 8.5 via publisher and a small 8.5=
 or even 9 aren't that much different in terms of money, but the medium gam=
e will get me way more fans and therefore faster to the 100k to self-publis=
h medium games.
</p><p>Also i put the value on speed only in the beginning, once i hit stag=
e2 and 100k fans our strategys aren't that much different. I try to keep al=
l modifiers the same and increase my score slightly via training, so i prod=
uce more Design/Tech with each game.
